  "name": "RabbitMQ",
  "label": "RabbitMQ Management HTTP API",
  "description": "Official RabbitMQ management HTTP API at http://localhost:15672 (not AMQP 0-9-1, not AMQP 1.0). exchange.send PUT /api/exchanges/{vhost}/{name}/publish; queue.send PUT /api/exchanges/{vhost}/amq.default/publish; queue.get POST /api/queues/{vhost}/{name}/get; trigger.listen is kind ingress. Auth HTTP basic (user + password). Customer owns the broker. Never log password or payloads. Docs: https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/management · https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/http-api-reference",
  "icon": "inbox",
